WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.002
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.204
We're very happy
you're here with us tonight.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.504
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.241
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer said yesterday

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:11.044
that President Biden's
"Build Back Better" agenda

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.046
will come up for a vote
before Christmas,

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.813
which is good,
because right now,

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:18.984
that manger is,
like, our sturdiest building.

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:20.853
President Biden
visited General Motors'

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.923
so-called Factory ZERO
electric-vehicle assembly plant

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.991
today in Michigan.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.526
And you could
tell he was impressed.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.162
He kept saying,
"So it's fully electric?

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.631
No horses at all?"

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:36.368
Jacob Chansley, also known as
the QAnon Shaman

00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:38.705
from the January Capitol
insurrection has been sentenced

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.006
to 41 months in prison.

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:43.009
Apparently, it's hard to find
a jury of his peers

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.711
the same day there's a
Renaissance fair.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:49.882
It's been announced that
the Los Angeles Staples Center

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:52.852
will change its name to
the Crypto.com Arena.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.322
So look for the Lakers to be up
by 20, then back down by 40,

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.224
then up by 10,000,

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.659
then back to zero.

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:04.164
Montana Senator Jon Tester
joked with reporter yesterday

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:06.599
that he expects
Democratic efforts to pass

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.801
President Biden's
"Build Back Better" agenda

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.669
to screw up his holiday plans.

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:12.471
Well, if it makes you
feel any better,

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:13.840
you're a Democrat in Montana.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.076
Your relatives probably don't
want to see you anyway.

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.145
The New Year's Eve celebration
in Times Square

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.814
will return in person this year
for participants

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:23.683
who are fully vaccinated
against the coronavirus.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:24.984
But if you're unvaccinated,

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:27.454
you'll have to settle
for going to the Super Bowl.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.591
Officials in
Florida recently discovered

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.660
a 20-foot-long metal box
washed up on a beach.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.665
Even weirder,
there wasn't any cocaine in it.

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:41.768
Well, now I've
seen everything, Florida.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:44.771
Google Cloud services
experienced an outage yesterday

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.906
which caused the music
platform Spotify to crash,

00:01:47.906 --> 00:01:52.578
costing artists a total
of over 75 cents in profits.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.682
Costco and Kraft Heinz
issued a recall last week

00:01:56.682 --> 00:02:00.119
for Kool-Aid drink mix due to
possible contamination of

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:02.255
small pieces of metal or glass.

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.223
Okay, well, here's a suggestion.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:07.694
Stop delivering it
through walls.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:10.496
That's modern, right?

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:13.633
That's still -- That's, like,
a modern ad campaign?

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.805
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.805 --> 00:02:23.209
I'm really excited
about this one.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.277
The sex-toy company
Dame Products

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:27.713
announced this week that it
has settled its lawsuit

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.482
with New York's MTA

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.184
and will be allowed to advertise
the brand on the subway,

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:36.455
though still no plan in place to
make the train come faster.

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:38.491
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:41.928
First down!

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.963
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:52.671
And, finally, boxer --
Former professional boxer --

00:02:52.671 --> 00:02:55.308
And, finally, former
professional boxer Mike Tyson

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.210
said in a new interview
that he takes

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.546
Sonoran Desert tone venom --

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:02.247
We're going to reboot and we're
going to get this right.

00:03:02.247 --> 00:03:04.617
I'm just so excited about that
"train come faster" joke.

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:07.287
[ Laughter ]
You know what I mean?

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.288
Like, I know everybody's like,
"Move on to the next joke,"

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:10.723
but I want to live
in the last one.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.759
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.096
And, finally, former
professional boxer Mike Tyson

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:21.066
said in a new interview that he
takes Sonoran Desert toad venom

00:03:21.066 --> 00:03:22.201
to hallucinate.

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.771
Responded the interviewer,
"I'm a lamp."

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.806
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.576
Hey, you guys,
that was the monologue.

